Z||000013||TRiAD||08-09-2001||12:27 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by maryjane:<BR><B> Triad, you did say if it came from anybody else it might have been cute, but...I think all of us were a little out of line making light of a question like that. good luck</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>That's the point entirely. No one else said it. <BR>You notice, the other "Magnum PI/Simon & Simon" replies got no undue attention (maybe a chuckle), but they saw that it was a serious question, and <I>kept the humor away from anything that could have been the real concern.</I> <P>It's not who posted it, but that he's the only one tasteless enough to do it. <P><BR>||||reg||1
