Z||000072||84Bill||08-10-2001||08:48 AM||||Thanks for breaking down the core elements of this thread. I thought it was about the pros and cons of the exhaust doughnut. <P>I don't understand your need to always have the last word in every situation to satisfy your desire to always be right. Its almost like watching a fish flop around after the water has receded. I almost pity you at times. <P>Why will you not drop it first? I mean come on man, Did you expect Triad to laugh at your joke? Your no friend of his and even as a friend that was a crappy thing to say but acceptable under certain conditions like your his best bud for life or something like that. Your the enemy here. I would have handled it very differently than Triad did and this thread would have been closed due to it's volatile nature  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I can see this thread as airing point for people that are tired of your "I'm always right/ You can't stop me/ I'm rubber your glue and anything you say is wrong and is corrected with harsh criticism, bounces off me and to hell with you" attitude.<P>BTW I don't think anyone will drop it at this rate.<BR>||||reg||1
