Z||000092||Mach10||08-11-2001||03:33 AM||||I was going to email Ed with this question, but I'm too lazy to open OE right now:<P>Why do you do this? Do you truly feel that people are impressed with what you have to say? It seems that when you run out of ideas, you bash spelling or grammatical mistakes. I don't run my work through a spellchecker. I don't usually need it. I'm a 4th year Anthro major, and I screw up all the time. I guess I must be pretty stupid. Any idiot can spend 15 minutes writing a 4-line post with a thesaurus in his hand. Big vocabulary does not make one smarter than the other, neither does perfect grammar. Saying "3 + 3 = 6" in perfect english using large mathematical terms does not make you a mathematician.<P>You seem to revel in the bad attention you recieve from the vast majority of the people reading the posts. Most likely, not everyone hates you, true. Most people here don't hate you. I don't. I find you annoying and crass, and I'm sure others here feel the same.<P>Telling me that you're sleeping with my wife would not go down easy. 6'10@215 or not, expect to be discovering a whole new world of pain and physiotherapy by a wimpy 5'6, 180lb 21 year old male. You knock ME cold, fair enough, but you still have to deal with a shattered elbow. Size matters not. In any case, I'm not married, nor is my girlfriend even in the same country as you, so I put that scenario in the "not applicable" pile.<P>Now, I realize that this is adding to the fire. Ed, I suggest you respond to me, in person, via email. If you have anything intelligent to say to me, go right ahead. Just remove the spam-blocks:<BR>umfoggsd&lt;at&gt;mail&lt;dot&gt;cc&lt;dot&gt;umanitoba&lt;dot&gt;ca<P>In the mean time, I will add my vote to the increasing pile of people that believe that you are an immature little man with a couple of grammar, legal, and dictionary texts within easy reach. Why don't you try being agreable for a change? Not every post needs a tasteless comment added by you. You don't have to agree, but you don't need to be so damn obnoxious. Write back soon, dearie.||||reg||3
