Z||000094||TRiAD||08-11-2001||10:02 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by grinthock:<BR><B>I wasn't gonna get into this....  Here is my thoughts, oh and for the record I DID NOT read this whole 3 pages of crap<P>1st - Personal flame wars have NO PLACE in here, do NOT start a topic to make a statement like that, TAKE IT OFF LIST!<P>2nd - That comment was hilarious, it was candid, it was cute, geez if you took that seriously GET SOME GOD DAMN THERAPY!<P><BR>Goodnight</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Grint; no offense, but you're right, you shouldn't have bothered posting. <P>If you had read the 3 pages (other than being really bored) you'd have seen a few things... <P>1) This thread was NOT started or intended as a flame war. I simply don't do that. <P>2) Ed and I apparently have accomplished the goal of this thread; a truce. <P>3) I am no longer involved in this thread, since it's goal was accomplished (other than responding to you, of course)<P>4) As for the comment and therapy; Ed even admitted the post was made with very different intentions than you would have posted it with. It was NOT "in good fun", at the time. But we've covered that, and have agreed to leave eachother alone here. <P>5) Next time, read the thread before you go posting your thoughts...it's been covered. You'll save yourself some embarrassment. <P>No offense; just bringing you up to speed here...<P>L8rs. <BR>||||reg||1
